# Unix line ends in every checkout, whatever the machine.
#
# Git for Windows turns text into CRLF on the way out (core.autocrlf=true is
# its default) and leaves `git status` clean. The suites read source files by
# the line, and three of them went red on a fresh clone with nothing changed.
# Everything in the index is already LF, so this rule rewrites no file.
# `npm run test:docs` holds this file to its first rule.
* text=auto eol=lf

# What a line-end conversion would corrupt, named instead of left to Git's
# guess: their bytes are measured (the kit, the textures, the bundle).
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.glb binary
*.ktx2 binary
*.woff2 binary
